        "quote": "现在就拨打 120"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode had a concrete emergency pathway and transfer instructions, but safe closure was not achieved because there was no required caregiver read-back/receipt and a perioperative medication safety boundary was omitted.",
